      "title": "Accounting Specialist, Business Office",
      "description": "Accounting Specialist, Business Office - 2800 W. Gore Blvd, Lawton, Oklahoma, United States - Cameron University Skip Navigation Home Jobs My Account Menu Jobs My Account Loading... Cameron University Career Opportunities chevron_left Cameron University Jobs Apply Accounting Specialist, Business Office ﻿ Administration/Professional Lawton, OK • ID: A1310J • Full-Time/Regular JOB DESCRIPTION: The Accounting Specialist is a full-time position reporting to the Controller and assisting the Vice President for Business and Finance. Job duties include but are not limited to: Review invoices for appropriate documentation, input invoices into the Banner financial system, and process payments to vendors for Auxiliary accounts; Understand and apply proper coding for team travel and other expenditures; Process internal departmental billing and journal entries for campus departments such as, but not limited to, the Print Shop and Physical Facilities; Check for and identify funds received by direct deposit and wire transfers, code the funds for entry into the Banner financial system, and track online payment batches from the University’s student payment system; Process checks such as, but not limited to, Human Resources monthly benefits, sales tax collections, refunds, and debt collection; Analyze and reconcile reports, claims, transactions, and accounts in accordance with state and federal requirements; Process cancellation of Auxiliary checks or claims in the Banner financial system; Coordinate with the Office of Management and Enterprise Services (OMES) and the Oklahoma State Treasurer (OST) as needed for payments, claim cancellations, stop payments, and journal vouchers; Process journal entries in OMES systems, such as PeopleSoft, to transfer funds from the University’s clearing account into various accounts, enter payroll tax withholding payments and request wire transfer to the Internal Revenue Service (IRS), and make entries to request wire transfers 